backups/

# Supabase CLI local state
supabase/.temp/

.env.local

# iCloud Drive sync collisions. This repo lives under ~/Desktop, and iCloud
# resolves a conflicting write by forking a numbered copy — "shuffle 2.ts"
# alongside "shuffle.ts". They are never intentional content; 33 of them had
# been committed by an auto-commit hook before this was noticed (2026-08-20).
#
# Deliberately limited to source extensions. Numbered ASSET files ARE
# legitimate here (assets/logos/"iPhone 14 & 15 Pro Max - 3.png"), and
# supabase/migrations/ is too load-bearing to ignore by glob — a real
# migration must never be silently untracked.
* [0-9].ts
* [0-9].tsx
* [0-9].js
* [0-9].jsx
* [0-9].json
